<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fiserv on recommend list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fiserv on recommend list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said analyst Brian Maimone initiated coverage of Fiserv Inc and put the stock on its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- set 12- to 18-month price target of $43. Shares closed Monday off 3/8 to 34-1/8.</p>
